flowchart LR
  I["Intent<br/>消息菜单撤回；observer 收到离线 type-3 事实"]
  C["Canonical ingress<br/>actor 使用 ActionBinding；observer 使用 Inbound/sync"]
  H["Helix<br/>Tick -> Effect -> Persist barrier"]
  A["Authority<br/>Go HTTP / WS / SQLite / PG"]
  F["InteractionFrameV2<br/>MessageContentVm::Recalled{text}、DeliveryVm::Recalled；原 message id/channel/author/createAt 保持同一逻辑行"]
  PC["PC<br/>WDIO Mock -> real invoke -> dual real"]
  MOB["Mobile<br/>GN GTest -> FFI -> Venus"]
  R["Unified report<br/>command/effect/store/frame/ack/render"]

  I --> C --> H
  H --> A --> H
  H --> F
  F --> PC --> R
  F --> MOB --> R

  X["FORBIDDEN<br/>端侧业务 reducer / raw fallback / receipt 冒充终态"]
  X -.fail closed.-> PC
  X -.fail closed.-> MOB
